---
// About — personal statement. Career detail now lives in the Experience section.
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-wrap" data-reveal>
    <div class="k i18n" data-en="About" data-pt="Sobre">About</div>
    <p
      class="about-lead i18n"
      data-en="I care about how a product feels and how it's built, in equal measure."
      data-pt="Me importo com como um produto se sente e como ele é feito, na mesma medida."
    >
      I care about how a product feels and how it's built, in equal measure.
    </p>
    <p
      class="about-body i18n"
      data-en="I'm a product designer with a frontend background, based in Guarulhos, São Paulo. I work close to product problems: understanding needs, shaping flows, building interfaces in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind, and documenting the decisions along the way. Lately I lean on AI-assisted workflows for research, planning, and quality checks, and I keep studying across design, tech, writing, and business to build products that create real value."
      data-pt="Sou product designer com base em frontend, em Guarulhos, São Paulo. Trabalho perto dos problemas de produto: entendo necessidades, modelo fluxos, construo interfaces em React, TypeScript e Tailwind, e documento as decisões pelo caminho. Ultimamente me apoio em workflows com IA para pesquisa, planejamento e verificações de qualidade, e sigo estudando em design, tech, escrita e negócio para construir produtos que geram valor real."
    >
      I'm a product designer with a frontend background, based in Guarulhos, São Paulo. I work close
      to product problems: understanding needs, shaping flows, building interfaces in React,
      TypeScript, and Tailwind, and documenting the decisions along the way. Lately I lean on
      AI-assisted workflows for research, planning, and quality checks, and I keep studying across
      design, tech, writing, and business to build products that create real value.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
